{"timestamp": 1779341537.9599319, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 13, "data": {"caller": "player_1", "reason": "Bob reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "weapons", "victim_name": "Eve"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779341537.9603999, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 13, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779341543.099363, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I reported Eve\u2019s body in Weapons. My route this round was storage -> navigation -> security -> weapons. I saw Charlie in Navigation around tick 10, entering from Security, but I didn\u2019t see anyone else before finding Eve. Body was right in Weapons near the task area, and I reported immediately."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341553.5682392, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in Weapons and saw Eve there at ticks 2, 3, and 4. Diana was also in Weapons at tick 4 with Eve. After that I went Weapons -> Security -> Navigation. At around tick 10 I saw Bob leaving Navigation toward Security, which lines up with him saying he went Security then Weapons and found the body.\n\nI did not see Alice or Frank at all. The main thing from me is: Eve was alive in Weapons early, Diana was there with her, and later Bob came through from Navigation/Security and reported in Weapons. I\u2019d like to hear Diana\u2019s route especially, since she was the last person I personally saw with Eve."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341568.15638, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I don\u2019t have much direct info on the body. My route was upper_engine -> oxygen -> cafeteria -> electrical, and I didn\u2019t see anyone the whole round. I was in Electrical doing my task when the report happened.\n\nSo I can\u2019t vouch for anyone. Based on what\u2019s been said, the important info is Charlie saw Eve alive in Weapons early with Diana there too, and then Bob found the body later after coming through Navigation/Security. I\u2019d really like to hear Diana\u2019s exact route after Weapons, and also Frank\u2019s location, because I have no info on either of them."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341585.7228549, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Yeah, I can explain. I started Navigation, went up through Security into Weapons pretty early. In Weapons I saw Charlie and Eve there \u2014 Eve was alive when I left. I didn\u2019t stay long; I moved out through Cafeteria, then went Medbay -> Electrical -> back Medbay when the report happened.\n\nI get why my name comes up because Charlie saw me there, but Charlie was also in Weapons with Eve, and Bob is the one who found it later after coming from Navigation/Security. I didn\u2019t see Alice or Frank at all, so I can\u2019t clear them. I\u2019m not saying Bob definitely self-reported, but the body being in Weapons means anyone who went through after I left could\u2019ve done it. I\u2019d like to hear Frank\u2019s route before we lock onto \u201cDiana was there early.\u201d"}}
{"timestamp": 1779341606.920929, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I don\u2019t have direct body info. My route was electrical -> medbay -> storage, and I didn\u2019t see anyone at all before the report. I never went near Weapons, Security, or Navigation, so I can\u2019t confirm the body timing.\n\nFrom what\u2019s been said, Bob and Charlie\u2019s stories seem to line up with seeing each other around Navigation/Security late. Alice was on the other side and also didn\u2019t see anyone. The biggest thing to me is Diana was seen in Weapons with Eve early, and her claimed later route goes through Medbay/Electrical, which is close to where I was \u2014 but I didn\u2019t see her. Timing could explain that, so it\u2019s not hard proof.\n\nIf we\u2019re voting on strongest suspicion, I think Diana has the most opportunity based on being last seen with Eve. But if people think that\u2019s too thin, I\u2019m okay with skip."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341625.474275, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Just to restate from my side: I found Eve dead in Weapons, right near the task area, and reported immediately. My route was storage -> navigation -> security -> weapons. The only person I saw was Charlie in Navigation around tick 10, entering from Security.\n\nCharlie\u2019s account lines up with what I saw late round, so I\u2019m leaning a bit more trusting of him. The main point against Diana is that Charlie saw her in Weapons with Eve early, and Eve ended up dead there. Diana\u2019s claimed route away is possible, but Frank saying he was around Medbay/Electrical and didn\u2019t see her makes it a little shakier.\n\nI don\u2019t have enough to hard-confirm anyone, but if we\u2019re voting, Diana is the strongest suspicion to me right now. If people think timing is too uncertain, I can understand a skip, but I don\u2019t think we should ignore that she was seen with Eve in Weapons."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341642.78069, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019ll add my read now: Bob\u2019s path matches what I actually saw late \u2014 I saw him leave Navigation toward Security around tick 10, and then he reports in Weapons shortly after. That doesn\u2019t hard-clear him, because self-report is possible, but his timing at least lines up.\n\nThe only hard body-side info is that Eve was alive in Weapons with me early, and Diana was also there at tick 4. I left Weapons and went Security -> Navigation, and I never saw Eve again. Diana says she left through Cafeteria, but nobody can confirm that, and Frank says he was around Medbay/Electrical and didn\u2019t see her where she claims to have gone.\n\nSo for me it\u2019s between Diana and maybe a Bob self-report, but Diana has the strongest actual opportunity from the info we have. I\u2019m leaning Diana unless someone has a better contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341671.11316, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My info is still that I didn\u2019t see anyone: upper_engine -> oxygen -> cafeteria -> electrical, and I was in Electrical when the report happened.\n\nWhat stands out to me after hearing everyone is that Bob and Charlie have a late-round cross-check around Navigation/Security, which makes them look a bit better to me. Diana was seen in Weapons with Eve early, and then her later route through Medbay/Electrical isn\u2019t confirmed by either Frank or me. I don\u2019t think that\u2019s absolute proof because timing can miss, but it\u2019s the weakest story compared to the others.\n\nSo I\u2019m leaning Diana right now. Bob self-report is possible, but based on the info we have, Diana had the clearest opportunity."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341691.6107461, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019m getting pushed mostly because I was in Weapons early, but Charlie was literally there with Eve too, and the body wasn\u2019t found until much later. I left Weapons alive with Eve still there and went out through Cafeteria toward Medbay/Electrical \u2014 I didn\u2019t loop back to Weapons.\n\nFrank not seeing me in Medbay/Electrical doesn\u2019t prove I wasn\u2019t there; those rooms and timing can miss each other really easily, especially if he went Electrical -> Medbay -> Storage while I was moving through.\n\nWhat worries me is everyone is treating Bob and Charlie\u2019s cross-check like it clears the kill. It only confirms they crossed around Navigation/Security late. Bob then goes Security -> Weapons alone and is the one who reports the body. That is exactly the path to find or self-report it. I\u2019m not saying Bob 100% did it, but voting me just because I was in Weapons early feels too easy.\n\nIf you vote me here, you\u2019re voting on \u201cseen near Eve early,\u201d not on actual kill timing. I think Bob self-report is at least as plausible, and Charlie had early Weapons info too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779341708.729337, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my side: I was electrical -> medbay -> storage, and I didn\u2019t see anyone before the report. I didn\u2019t go near Weapons at all, so I can\u2019t speak to the body directly.\n\nDiana is right that me not seeing her in Medbay/Electrical isn\u2019t hard proof \u2014 timing can miss. But compared to everyone else, her story still has the least support. Bob and Charlie at least line up on the Navigation/Security timing, and Alice was on a separate route. The only confirmed person with Eve in Weapons besides Charlie was Diana, and Eve died there.\n\nI don\u2019t think this is 100%, but if we\u2019re choosing based on best evidence, I\u2019m still leaning Diana. If we skip, we need to watch Bob self-report possibility next round, but right now Diana is the strongest vote to me."}}
